ting code instead of just writing specs. Steve and Gene argue that anyone in tech-adjacent roles who isn't learning vibe coding risks becoming obsolete, as the future of software development increasingly involves AI collaboration across all roles, not just traditional engineering positions.\n\nPre-order the book here: https://www.amazon.com/Vibe-Coding-Bu...\n\n00:00 Introduction to the Vibe Coding Podcast\n00:31 Target Audience for the Vibe Coding Book\n01:04 Challenges in Modern Programming\n02:01 The Joy and Struggles of Programming\n02:38 The Complexity of Building Modern Software\n03:14 Rekindling the Joy of Programming\n03:58 The Vibe Coding Loop\n04:54 AI in Programming: Expectations vs. Reality\n06:57 Building Trust in AI Tools\n10:01 The Evolution of Prompting Skills\n14:03 Targeting Senior Engineers and Technology Leaders\n20:46 The Rise of AI Collaboration\n21:16 The Impact of Agentic Coding\n24:12 Challenges with Monolithic Systems\n27:23 Empowering Non-Engineers with AI\n38:25 The Future of Vibe Coding","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1243,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwiP7K71h7qXAxVWQC0EHVYhHrFIyM-IoKfIoJooygEEX56sXA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljRk9kTlhjdnFTdmcxSGx5V3V3c09MbnxBSTVJdTV2dWVmWmRtbmR0WjJnWGUyUkdVSzlWMUtiRXQ3V282MXh3MlVaLTFBak92WHA4NWNtQnBxandpZ2l0SWR3V2tRdTByN0t5RkdFSjVOWUtlNXRzWlFOd1hyREZvSUtU\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FVibe-Coding-Building-Production-Grade-Software%2Fdp%2F1966280025\u0026v=KDSCQnQCJ8g","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljRk9kTlhjdnFTdmcxSGx5V3V3c09MbnxBSTVJdTV2dWVmWmRtbmR0WjJnWGUyUkdVSzlWMUtiRXQ3V282MXh3MlVaLTFBak92WHA4NWNtQnBxandpZ2l0SWR3V2tRdTByN0t5RkdFSjVOWUtlNXRzWlFOd1hyREZvSUtU\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FVibe-Coding-Building-Pro